															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/heatstroke" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(7015846); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7015846&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605924404" alt="HeatStroke" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7015846)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/heatstroke" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(7015846); return false;" >HeatStroke</a></span> <span class="odate time_1605854801 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">20 Nov 2020 06:46</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4823456">
									

<p>Elevator Pitch: A horrific humanoid that can only be seen using UV rays. This humanoid makes any person they encounter a narcoleptic, anyone affected by the humanoid will be stalked until they fall asleep which they will then enter the Sandman’s dreamscape where they are lured into a sense of security before being murdered and/or eaten alive gruesomely through mutilation. The subject of this encounter will be conscious the whole time while they’re unable to escape as it slowly eats and/or mutilates the subject causing them to become psychotic. When the subject wakes up within the next few hours all the injuries they sustained in their dream will become a reality.</p>
<p>Central Narrative: On 9/14/15&#160;48-year-old male Christian Andersen was arrested for the gruesome murder and mutilation of his wife and 2 children. During interrogation Andersen spontaneously mutilated which and immediately afterward 2 officers within the vicinity suddenly fell asleep. This alerted the foundation to possible anomalous activity in the Østerbro district of Copenhagen, Denmark. After evacuating and securing the district 2 MTF members suddenly fell asleep and upon their awakening, they were yelling and screaming “IT KILLED ME AND IT’LL KILL YOU AGAIN!” The 2 MTF agents were detained in a humanoid containment chamber and were then interviewed. It was stated that a humanoid with a split jaw ravaged and ate them alive. One of the MTF agents screamed out in pain and died instantly, showing signs of severe internal bleeding. When dissected it was discovered that his internal organs were missing or mutilated. On 9/19/15 at 3:55&#160;pm a humanoid with the traits the deceased MTF agent stated was spotted at Amager Strandpark and was later contained by an MTF squadron.</p>
<p>Hook/Attention-Grabber: &quot;It dragged me into my nightmare where it wished for all to feed its slumbering insanity.&quot;</p>
<p>Additional Notes: Format would be ConProcs, Description, then an Addendum or two where you could put, like, accounts of a victim's experience or stuff. Also, the “it killed me and it’ll kill you again&quot; has no relation to what the SCP does after you wake up they were just spouting nonsense due to their new psychotic nature.</p>

