<p><strong>Note: Not a verified reviewer.</strong></p>
<p>Reading your Central Narrative, I found myself asking this question: <em>How does the Foundation know any of this?</em> If the man dies after being affected by the anomaly, and everything prior to him going crazy happens in a dream, how would the Foundation find it out? Remember, we're supposed to see this all happen from the Foundation's perspective, not the victim's. If you want to include it all, I suggest you write a tale instead (which would obviously require a little tweaking in terms of the anomaly and all).</p>

